  update public.faq_i18n set answer = $f3$It is, especially on long stays. At Aerovalet an uncovered spot goes from R$ 16.90 a day for 1 to 6 days to R$ 11.90 a day over a week and R$ 6.90 a day over 30 days, which is 59% less. The covered spot follows the same curve, from R$ 19.90 to R$ 8.90 a day over a month. At Aeropark, which takes bookings from two days, the uncovered spot goes from R$ 21.90 to R$ 17.90 a day. The official car park charges the same daily rate whatever the stay. Aerovalet prices from its 28 October 2026 table and Aeropark prices from its 19 October 2026 table.$f3$
   where faq_id = '7288e5fb-050c-47a0-80a4-ed143bf3b461' and locale = 'en' and md5(answer) = 'c0972cd1ea097e96a0ac1a48cdf215d9';
  get diagnostics n = row_count;
  if n <> 1 then raise exception 'frescor: % · % · % mudou desde a leitura de 03/11', 'faq_i18n', 'compensa-deixar-o-carro-mais-dias-no-aeroporto-de-guarulhos', 'en answer'; end if;
  total := total + 1;

  -- faq_i18n · compensa-deixar-o-carro-mais-dias-no-aeroporto-de-guarulhos · es · answer
