  -- faq_i18n · vale-mais-a-pena-o-estacionamento-oficial-de-guarulhos-ou-um-particular · en · answer
  update public.faq_i18n set answer = $f51$It depends on the official sector and on how many days the car stays. At the Movepark partners an uncovered spot costs from R$ 207.00 for 30 days, or R$ 6.90 a day. Per the August 2026 research, the Economy sector charged R$ 22.00 a day, which would be R$ 660.00 over the same period, and the sectors next to the terminal charged R$ 100.00, adding up to R$ 3,000.00. The official car park charges the same daily rate whatever the length of stay, so the gap grows with the trip. Aerovalet price from its 28 October 2026 table.$f51$
