  update public.faq_i18n set answer = $f64$Guarulhos has both, and the difference shows up in the price. At Aerovalet an uncovered spot starts at R$ 16.90 a day and a covered one at R$ 19.90; over 30 days they fall to R$ 6.90 and R$ 8.90 a day. At Aeropark entry is from two days, and over 30 days the uncovered spot comes to R$ 17.90 and the covered one to R$ 23.90 a day. Covering shields from sun, rain and hail, which matters for anyone leaving the car for weeks. Both units also offer valet, where the staff park the car for you. Aerovalet prices from its 28/10/2026 table and Aeropark prices from its 19/10/2026 table.$f64$
