| Urban Park | 2,81 km | 4,9 | 36.955 | 06/09/2026 |
| Ponce Park | 3,91 km | 4,9 | 16.439 | 06/09/2026 |
| Airport Park | 2,88 km | 4,8 | 6.645 | 06/09/2026 |
| Decolar Park | 1,57 km | 3,9 | 2.510 | 06/09/2026 |
