### Is an insured car park the same as car insurance?

No. What the two declare is cover taken out by the lot itself, and it does not replace the legal liability, which exists under Precedent 130 regardless.

If that point is decisive for you, ask what the policy covers, what the limit per vehicle is and what it excludes. Movepark publishes the branch's declaration and does not audit a third party's policy. It is also worth checking what your own insurance says about a vehicle parked for many days.

