The official car park sits inside the complex, with access to the terminal on foot and no van in between. It is the choice for a stay of a few hours, when the transfer costs more than the saving on the rate. In Curitiba, the comparison with the official lot is the tightest in the network. In the collection of 27 August 2026, its cheapest area advertised a lower daily rate than Abbapark's uncovered space on the 27 October 2026 table. The partner's advantage appears against the official lot's covered space.

