A good share of the surrounding lots put none of this on their website. Four questions over a messaging app settle it in five minutes:

- Does the lot have a controlled gate and issue an entry receipt with plate and time?
- Are the cameras monitored live, and for how many days are the images kept?
- Is the gate staffed 24 hours, and the transfer too?
- If there is damage, what is the procedure and who signs the record?

If the answer comes back vague on all four, you already know enough. A lot that works properly answers fast, because it answers that every week. Four clear answers already tell you whether it is safe to leave the car at Afonso Pena Airport with that team.

